WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:08.932
When a customer is unhappy, every hour counts. Here is how NPS Survey CX OS turns that answer into a saved customer.

2
00:00:10.330 --> 00:00:17.775
Pick what to measure: NPS, satisfaction, effort, stars or a simple thumbs up. Every card shows the real scale.

3
00:00:19.180 --> 00:00:22.805
Customers answer in seconds, in your brand, on any device.

4
00:00:24.210 --> 00:00:29.341
The thank-you page reacts to the score. An unhappy customer can ask for help on the spot.

5
00:00:30.740 --> 00:00:35.642
AI reads every answer the moment it arrives: churn risk, mood and topic.

6
00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:42.906
A follow-up opens on its own, with an owner and a deadline, so no unhappy customer slips through.

7
00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:48.614
Everything is on one screen: their words, the revenue at risk, and the clock.

8
00:00:50.010 --> 00:00:53.874
Reach out in one click, with a personal email that is already written.

9
00:00:55.270 --> 00:00:58.645
Then close the loop, and record what you did and why it happened.

10
00:01:00.270 --> 00:01:04.800
Saved, in four minutes. On time, with a follow-up survey one click away.

11
00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:13.168
Every Account and Contact now carries a Customer Experience panel, with an AI summary and the next best action.

12
00:01:14.570 --> 00:01:21.360
Leaders see the whole story on one screen: NPS, response rate, delivery and the drivers that move the score.

13
00:01:22.760 --> 00:01:29.083
Revenue CX ranks accounts by the money at stake, so you protect what is at risk and grow what is happy.

14
00:01:30.480 --> 00:01:35.276
And nine AI digital workers run around the clock, inside your Salesforce org.

15
00:01:36.680 --> 00:01:41.984
Every unhappy customer gets a call back. Book a demo at NPS surveys dot com.
